  "description": "IP Security Analyzer: A pro-grade Cloudflare Worker for forensic intelligence. Detects VPNs, Proxies \u0026 Hosting IPs via heuristic ASN auditing. Includes Security Scoring, WebRTC Leak Test, ISP classification, and Geo-location. Built with a modern Bento UI and live terminal logs. Powerful, open-source and real-time network forensic tool.",
